sequenceDiagram
    participant OS as SystemUI
    participant MA as MainActivity
    participant AT as AppTheme
    participant CS as ColorTokens (lightScheme/darkScheme)
    participant SC as AppStatusColors (LocalStatusColors)
    participant PG as PageScreen (e.g. PublishScreen)
    participant AC as AppCard / AppTopBar / AppButton / StatusTag / LoadingIndicator

    OS->>MA: onCreate() -> setContent
    MA->>AT: AppTheme { ... }  (替换默认 MaterialTheme)
    AT->>CS: isSystemInDarkTheme() ? darkScheme : lightScheme
    AT->>SC: CompositionLocalProvider(LocalStatusColors provides Light/Dark)
    AT->>PG: content() with themed ambient (colorScheme + typography + statusColors)
    PG->>AC: AppTopBar(title, onBackClick)
    AC->>MA: arrow tint = MaterialTheme.colorScheme.primary
    AC->>MA: title color = MaterialTheme.colorScheme.onSurface
    PG->>AC: AppCard { ... }
    AC->>MA: Surface(color=colorScheme.surface, shape=Shape.radiusLg, elevation=1.dp)
    PG->>AC: AppButton(text, onClick)
    AC->>MA: background=colorScheme.primary, shape=Shape.radiusSm
    PG->>AC: StatusTag(StatusType.Pending)
    AC->>SC: MaterialTheme.statusColors.pending.container / content
    PG->>AC: LoadingIndicator()
    AC->>MA: CircularProgressIndicator(color=colorScheme.primary)
    PG->>PG: text uses MaterialTheme.typography.titleMedium / bodyLarge
